(i) the dates on which 'the BPSC' conducted examination BPSC' and further whether it was in the month of July or in September (or both) on which date (06.09.2002), he was apprehended;
 (ii) further, whether Genera  Knowledge test took place  06.09.2002 at Patna College Center are not;
Patna High Court CR. MISC. No.56054 of 2015(5) dt.23-03-2023 (iii)Whether any seizure list was prepared or not?
